# OPC Scaffold — Three Pillars

1. **OPC Methodology** (`skills/opc/`) — business planning → `opc-doc/`
2. **Agency Agents** (`agents/agency/`) — specialized personas
3. **12-Factor Agents** (`services/agent/`) — production agent runtime

Run `.\scripts\sync-integrations.ps1` before using opc/agency assets.

## Engineering rules

- Follow AGENTS.md and docs/standards/
- Prompts in `/prompts/` · Registry in `agents/registry.yaml`
- Agent runs via `/api/v1/agents/runs` — structured JSON only
- Sprint: one module at a time · `make test` before done
